Changelog: 11-11-2026

Release 0.1.0. First PS5 version: the PS5's sources
(bazzite_console_core.sensors: k10temp, ps5_fan, ps5_gpufreq, amdgpu ps5_sensors on kernel 7.3.1 and later), rows
for the SoC and board temperatures and the GPU temperature limit, the fan as duty and mode (the PS5's fan reports no
RPM); no GPU volt, VRM or governor-range rows (the PS5 has none).
